**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.expo
**/.astro
coverage
data
artifacts
backups
design
PRODUCT_PLAN.md
playwright-report
test-results
verify-report
*.log

# Local tooling state: agent worktrees are full repo copies, and the code index is local only.
.claude
.codegraph
docs
engine
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
